WEBVTT

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:03.650
<i>As long as good exists in this world,</i>

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:05.310
<i>so, too, shall evil thrive.</i>

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>Narrator</b>

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>Takumi Tsutsui</b>

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:08.320
<i>But behind this eternal 
clash of good and evil,</i>

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:10.710
<i>there is another battle that goes unseen.</i>

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:14.310
My fellows!

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:19.490
<b>Close-Combat Executive 
Fenrir</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:19.480
Thank you for participating in 
this Agastia Employee Retreat.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:21.160
Indeed.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.520
Your courage is impressive, Kuroitsu!

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:27.110
No more monsters coming than this, huh?

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.510
<b>Secret Society: Agastia Monster Development Department
Assistant: Touka Kuroitsu</b>

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.510
<b>Secret Society Agastia Monster Development Department
New Assistant: Wolf Bete</b>

00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:30.980
We're so happy to be here!

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.300
<i>This isn't an employee retreat...</i>

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.270
<i>It's an executive conference!</i>

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:11.980
<b>— Episode 11 —

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:18.010
Kuroitsu is a familiar 
face from our meetings.

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:20.950
But is the wolf girl the 
only monster participant?

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:23.020
I think it shows guts.

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:26.250
<b>Freezing Combat Executive
Fleurety</b>

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:26.240
Wish I had someone with nerve 
like that in my department.

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:27.420
Absolutely not.

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:30.870
<b>Black Beast Transformation Executive
Skylla</b>

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:31.060
Wolfie girl here is like my 
little sister, you know.

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:32.000
Little sister?

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:36.390
We created you using Lady 
Skylla's design as reference.

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:38.760
She really helped with your development.

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:43.260
<b>Secret Agent Executive
Peryton</b>

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:41.840
Making your personal specs public...

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:43.370
Unbelievable.

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:47.270
I think it suggests a lack 
of true executive mindset.

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:50.150
Listen to you, Peryton!

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:55.150
Personally, I think a true executive 
mindset demands being a team player.

00:02:55.430 --> 00:02:58.590
Why do you always have to feud like this?

00:02:59.310 --> 00:03:01.900
And, as usual, not everyone came.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:04.410
Who's missing this time?

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:07.340
Camula was too busy with work.

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:10.290
Then there were Kraken and Amanoiwato...

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:14.170
<b>Polar Research Executive
Salamander</b>

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:14.480
Pretty typical for rocky-jerk 
and squiddy-jerk.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:21.540
To leave our headquarters bereft 
of executives is far too perilous!

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:25.730
I, Amanoiwato, shall devote 
myself to its guardianship!

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:25.930
<b>Base Defense Executive
Amanoiwato</b>

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:29.430
I declare this our last line of defense!

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:33.440
<b>Aqueous Combat Executive
Kraken</b>

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:31.730
I agree!

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:35.600
Agastia's headquarters must 
not be left undefended!

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:40.060
I think it's fine with the chief 
of staff there, personally.

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:43.450
<b>Force of Power Executive
Warrior of Jaguar</b>

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:43.460
They're all a bunch of Nervous Nellies!

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:48.040
<i>Miss Kuroitsu... How could you 
join an executives-only retreat?</i>

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:50.610
<i>She's so fearless.</i>

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:54.320
Don't be scared, Wolfie boy.

00:03:54.930 --> 00:04:00.840
It's an unprecedented chance to learn about 
the capabilities of typically aloof executives!

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:03.140
<i>Like I'm in any position 
to think about that!</i>

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:06.040
<i>But that's the reason she did it, huh?</i>

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:09.280
My fine ladies, Miss Kuroitsu, Miss Bete.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:09.350
<b>Strategic Intelligence Executive
Long-range Uncle</b>

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:12.860
There's a bar I frequent with 
a fine view of the city lights.

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:15.560
Would you care to make it a threesome?

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:20.670
That's a rather antiquated 
come-on, Lord Uncle.

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:23.110
And invitin' two people 
at once is pretty shady.

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:26.230
I simply can't bear to be 
alone for long, you see.

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:30.060
I greatly prefer the company of friends!

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:35.500
Then take your pathetic flirting 
to that sweaty bunch over there!

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:36.740
Keep your distance, Wolfie girl!

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:39.020
Men are the true wolves, every one of them!

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:41.940
Huh? But I'm—

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:43.930
Give it up, Wolf Bete.

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:46.430
Skylla's really—

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:52.400
—really... smart.

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:54.520
He hedged it.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:58.530
Pathetic behavior from an evil executive!

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:01.290
But I tell you, Wolfie girl, 
all men really are beasts!

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:04.380
You really must afford them a wide berth.

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:09.150
<i>Wolf's instincts recognized Skylla, 
who shared his genetic factors,</i>

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:11.180
<i>as his superior.</i>

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:17.020
<i>Additionally, his canine nature made it 
impossible for him to defy a superior.</i>

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:20.100
Yeah, I'm freakin'...

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:23.550
I mean, I'm quite afraid of men, too!

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:26.940
Are you, poor dear? There, there...

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:28.860
Wolfie boy...

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:31.680
All right, let's get our rooms.

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:34.640
Come get your key when I call your name.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.120
Okay!

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:40.120
First up... oh? The writing's so small. 
I must be getting on in years...

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:41.190
I think she likes you, Wolf.

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:43.820
It's important to have traditional desserts
 in the room. I wonder what they've got.

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:42.210
Take care.

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:43.830
What's that supposed to mean?

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:48.320
<b>Dimension Shifting Executive
Weaver Monster Arachne</b>

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:46.600
Skylla is an exceptionally 
temperamental person.

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:49.530
When she takes a liking to 
something, she's unstoppable.

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:51.320
Once, long ago, I...

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:09.560
You can't beat traditional inns!

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:13.110
I only just got to my room,

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:15.460
but I'm already frickin' exhausted.

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:18.170
Wait... is this my room?!

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:19.380
Well, yeah.

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:21.370
I'm with you, Miss Kuroitsu?!

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:24.020
What's the big deal, Wolfie boy?

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:26.830
You're a delicate maiden who's 
"quite afraid of men," aren't you?

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:31.740
Wolfie girl!

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:34.360
Let's go have a little fun!

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:37.280
Y-Yes, Lady Skylla!

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:40.430
Give it your best, Wolfie boy!

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:45.990
But now it's time to get to work!

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:52.640
Observing the executives?

00:06:53.460 --> 00:06:56.270
Well, passion for your work 
is a pretty decent quality.

00:06:56.550 --> 00:06:58.430
Thank you so much!

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:01.940
As a secret agent, I refuse to cooperate.

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:05.780
What's the big deal if she watches a while?

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:07.750
But get this, Kuroitsu.

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:10.770
"Executive" ain't a title 
just anyone can get.

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:13.840
We don't go showin' off our 
capabilities that easy.

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:18.050
And if you do happen to see 'em, 
it might just be the last thing you—

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:23.010
Lay off me, you brats! I ain't merchandise!

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:29.040
Still... he sure is cute...

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:32.300
The dumplings at that shop 
were really delicious.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:35.130
Are we on a food tour now?

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:37.820
I run the supply warehouses, after all.

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:40.570
Testing out supplies is part of my job.

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:45.060
<i>The ice powers of Freezing 
Combat Executive Fleurety</i>

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:49.770
<i>were used to keep Agastia's 
foodstuffs in cold storage.</i>

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:52.240
Hey!

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:54.690
Quit cuddlin' me, darn it!

00:07:54.690 --> 00:07:57.080
I'm so sorry, Lord Salamander.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:59.100
I didn't even realize I was doing it.

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:02.330
<i>Wonder if they'd be better chilled...</i>

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:07.930
It doesn't look like you're working to me.

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:12.690
And what need is there to 
eat anything but hyorogan?

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:18.330
<i>Hyorogan, or ration pellets, are a portable 
foodstuff eaten by the ninja of old.</i>

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:20.800
But those are so...

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:22.300
They're just so...

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:24.220
What, they're not good?

00:08:24.220 --> 00:08:28.740
Well, they started making them bigger 
and bigger to make them taste better.

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:32.800
Now they're hard to carry around, 
take forever to prepare,

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:34.940
and you eat 'em with a knife and fork!

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:38.880
All in the pursuit of superior flavors!

00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:42.050
Ration pellets shouldn't be about flavor.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:47.120
I told you to quit cuddlin' me, darn it!

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:51.300
But you're just so smooth and squishy...

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:54.690
Knock it off!

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:59.140
I can't be satisfied unless I'm number one!

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:01.250
All right. And?

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:07.510
You and I are the only executives 
specialized for close-range combat, Fenrir.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:10.550
I don't think I need to say more.

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:12.000
I see.

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:13.410
Yes...

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:15.270
Warrior of Jaguar.

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:17.650
You leave me no other option.

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:24.030
You wish to develop a joint 
finishing move. Is that correct?

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:25.330
Hell no!

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:28.800
I wanna fight and find out 
who's better once and for all!

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:34.800
I have spent a great deal of time simulating 
executive combination attacks.

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.680
Well, stop it! It's creepy!

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:41.710
We executives can't just start dishin' 
out team attacks like we're pals!

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:43.910
We could never show our 
faces to a hero again!

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:46.680
It is a tricky suggestion.

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:54.250
The real problem is that Lord Jaguar 
would never actually do as he was told.

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:57.450
What, you got a particular problem with me?

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:00.020
Oh, of course not!

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:02.070
It's a particular problem with 
you and Lord Uncle both.

00:10:02.070 --> 00:10:07.560
Why are you sticking me 
in the creep category?!

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:09.710
You'll pay for that!

00:10:10.850 --> 00:10:12.250
I won't allow this.

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:17.020
Violence against subordinates is an 
unacceptable violation of our code of conduct!

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:19.720
I want to see you become

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:24.890
a rule-abiding executive who keeps 
strictly to the straight and narrow!

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:27.970
How the hell is this old 
man an evil executive?!

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:30.950
Who made you to be this way?!

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:37.110
Hey, Eldridge, you're pretty good at this!

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:42.450
<b>Scientific Advisor Executive
Eldridge</b>

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:42.450
And I can tell you're someone who spends all 
her time in her castle playing this junk.

00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:47.220
You don't usually venture 
this far out, Lady Arachne.

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:49.810
I was sure you'd sit this trip out.

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:53.590
I just love hot springs!

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:56.830
Miss Kuroitsu...

00:10:56.830 --> 00:11:00.460
This game's characters are truly intriguing!

00:11:00.460 --> 00:11:01.350
Ouch!

00:11:01.350 --> 00:11:06.310
They change from humanoids into 
mollusks in the blink of an eye!

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:10.600
Is this cellular reorganization 
accomplished with electric stimuli?!

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:14.480
And then they can swim around in 
the fluid they've splashed about!

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:18.740
Wait... do they fuse with it on a molecular 
level to transmit their mass?!

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:23.150
Extroverted nerds are the dang worst!

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:29.730
What are you doing, Lord Uncle?

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:35.260
Lonely and alone, I'm managing 
the day's goods transfers.

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:38.430
Miss Arachne refused to entertain 
my company, you see.

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:42.550
You'd better watch out, Lady Arachne.

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:45.270
Lord Uncle's gonna come on to you.

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:49.520
You have nothing to worry 
about there, Miss Kuroitsu.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:53.270
I am Miss Arachne's captive, 
both figuratively and literally.

00:11:58.010 --> 00:12:00.610
Yeah, Uncle's just annoying to be around.

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:03.780
Dude won't ever be real with you, y'know?

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:06.070
You wound me!

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:10.910
I could speak of your charms 
all night long, Miss Arachne.

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:20.630
It seems the report that Agastia's 
executives would be here today was correct.

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:23.160
If we finish them all off in one go,

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:26.560
we can make the jump to 
the national level in a flash!

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:29.310
We won't rest until it's done!

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:32.680
We are the Assassin Rangers: Jyuyushi!

00:12:33.170 --> 00:12:35.190
When it comes to taking down evil,

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:37.180
there's nothing we won't do!

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:41.790
Come to me, Wolfie girl!

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:43.590
I'll wash you off.

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:46.440
N-No thanks, I'm good here.

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:48.200
Come along.

00:12:48.820 --> 00:12:51.050
R-Right...

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:54.540
CLOSE-COMBAT SPECIALIZED MONSTER

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:54.540
m 58 114 l 261 117 260 135 223 164 59 163

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:54.540
His basic settings were based primarily on the executive Skylla,
 allowing superior cost performance relative to his stats.
Despite highly versatile combat abilities, he is more valued as
 a mascot from a marketing perspective.

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:54.540
SPECIAL ABILITIES

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:54.540
m 60 203 l 59 225 193 226 224 213 218 202

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:54.540
